    "title": "REWARDING METTLE WITH MEDALS",
    "text": "Thursday, August 20, 2026\nSwimmers are draped with medals, including Olympian Elizabeth Beisel (below), at Potter Cove after completing the 2-mile swim across the East Passage from Coasters Harbor Island. Beisel, a 2010 graduate of North Kingstown High, finished third overall with a time of 44 minutes, five seconds. She was the first female to cross the finish line. Please see story, Page 16. PHOTOS BY ANDREA VON HOHENLEITEN",
